#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg:1 of
msgid "Aggregate the grouped LiteFrame using one or more functions."
msgstr "使用一个或多个函数聚合分组的 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg:3 of
msgid ""
"Supports string function names (e.g. ``\"sum\"``, ``\"mean\"``), "
"callables, or lists thereof.  The result has one row per group with the "
"group key columns prepended; no MultiIndex is produced."
msgstr ""
"支持字符串函数名（例如 ``\"sum\"``、``\"mean\"``）、可调用对象或它们的"
"列表。结果每组有一行，并前置分组键列；不会生成 MultiIndex。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg:7 of
msgid ""
"Aggregation specification.  A string names a built-in reduction "
"(``\"sum\"``, ``\"mean\"``, ``\"min\"``, ``\"max\"``, ``\"prod\"``, "
"``\"count\"``, ``\"size\"``, ``\"var\"``, ``\"std\"``, ``\"median\"``, "
"``\"sem\"``, ``\"skew\"``, ``\"kurt\"``, ``\"nunique\"``, ``\"all\"``, "
"``\"any\"``).  A callable is applied per group.  A list applies multiple "
"aggregations to all (non-key) columns.  A dict maps column names to "
"function(s).  If None, only the group keys are returned."
msgstr ""
"聚合规范。字符串命名内置归约函数 （``\"sum\"``、``\"mean\"``、``\"min\"``"
"、``\"max\"``、``\"prod\"``、``\"count\"``、``\"size\"``、``\"var\"``、``"
"\"std\"``、``\"median\"``、``\"sem\"``、``\"skew\"``、``\"kurt\"``、``\""
"nunique\"``、``\"all\"``、``\"any\"``）。可调用对象按组应用。列表对所有（"
"非键）列应用多个聚合。字典将列名映射到函数。如果为 None，则仅返回分组键。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg:16 of
msgid "Execution strategy for the aggregation."
msgstr "聚合的执行策略。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg:18 of
msgid ""
"If True, only numeric columns are aggregated.  If None, the default "
"depends on the function."
msgstr "如果为 True，则仅聚合数值列。如果为 None，则默认值取决于函数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg:21 of
msgid "Frame type passed to callable aggregations."
msgstr "传递给可调用聚合的框架类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg:23 of
msgid "Additional keyword arguments forwarded to the aggregation function(s)."
msgstr "转发给聚合函数的额外关键字参数。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg:26 of
msgid ""
"Lazy LiteFrame with one row per group and the aggregation results in the "
"remaining columns.  Call ``.execute()`` to materialize."
msgstr ""
"惰性 LiteFrame，每组一行，聚合结果在其余列中。调用 ``.execute()`` 来实例"
"化。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.agg.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

